      ["ty","We're going to eat at Léa's. (use ‹nous›)","Nous allons manger chez Léa.","‹aller› · ‹manger› · ‹chez Léa›","vont","The ‹nous› form of ‹aller› is ‹allons›."],
      ["ty","This weekend, I'm going to go biking.","Ce week-end, je vais faire du vélo.|Je vais faire du vélo ce week-end.|Ce weekend, je vais faire du vélo.|Je vais faire du vélo ce weekend.","‹ce week-end› · ‹aller› · ‹faire du vélo›","fais","In the ‹futur proche›, ‹faire› stays in the infinitive after ‹je vais›."]
